# JSONPlaceholder API Testing

API testing of JSONPlaceholder (https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com) using Postman.

## Tools
Postman, Excel, GitHub

## What I tested
- GET all posts and a single post
- Invalid post ID (negative test)
- POST, PUT and DELETE requests
- Status codes checked with Postman test scripts

## Folders
- postman: collection file
- test-cases: test case sheet
- screenshots: test run results

## How to run
Import the file from the postman folder into Postman and click Run.

## Result
6 test cases executed, all passed.

## Note
JSONPlaceholder is a fake API, so POST, PUT and DELETE are simulated.

